          "phase": "verification",
          "title": "ESLint unbound-method error in materials seed",
          "symptom": "eslint . --max-warnings 0 failed with `@typescript-eslint/unbound-method` at database/main/seeds/202612010002_materials_seed.ts:31:15, so the lint stage exited 1.",
          "rootCause": "`async run({ repository })` destructured the `repository` factory method off SeedContext and then invoked it as a free function, detaching it from its receiver; the rule cannot verify `this` is unused and rejects the call.",
